er of health challenges.', 'Active'), ('CFK_SDG06_SEC_014', 'Secondary education', 'Biodiversity and water conservation', 'Link between water quality and aquatic ecosystem health.', 'Active'), ('CFK_SDG06_SEC_015', 'Secondary education', 'Biodiversity and water conservation', 'Contribution of water conservation efforts to sustainable ecosystems and global biodiversity goals.', 'Active'), ('CFK_SDG06_SEC_016', 'Secondary education', 'Water pollution and aquatic life', 'Impacts of pollution (industrial, agricultural runoff) on aquatic life and ecosystems.', 'Active'), ('CFK_SDG06_SEC_017', 'Secondary education', 'Water pollution and aquatic life', 'Case studies of water pollution (e.g., Aral Sea, industrial contamination) and effects on biodiversity.', 'Active'), ('CFK_SDG06_SEC_018', 'Secondary education', 'Systems thinking and water challenges', 'Water challenges require systemic solutions integrating scientific, societal, and environmental perspectives.', 'Active'), ('CFK_SDG06_SEC_019', 'Secondary education', 'Systems thinking and water challenges', 'STSE (science, technology, society, environment) approach for examining water issues and sustainable solutions.', 'Active'), ('CFK_SDG06_SEC_020', 'Secondary education', 'Case studies and global water issues', 'Healthy watersheds: examples like the Amazon and Colorado river basins illustrate their role in water quality and availability.', 'Active'), ('CFK_SDG06_SEC_021', 'Secondary education', 'Case studies and global water issues', 'Global water issues: droughts, water conflicts, and pollution, with socio-economic and environmental consequences.', 'Active'), ('CFK_SDG06_SEC_022', 'Secondary education', 'Interdisciplinary projects and real-world strategies', 'Design projects addressing water scarcity, pollution, or management, with innovative solutions for treatment, conservation, and efficient use.', 'Active'), ('CFK_SDG06_SEC_023', 'Secondary education', 'Interdisciplinary projects and real-world strategies', 'Study